  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "Chicago Traffic Safety Analysis (LG Project)",
  "alternateName": "LG",
  "description": "An end-to-end data curation and analysis project examining injury severity in traffic crashes within the City of Chicago. Combines the Chicago Data Portal Crashes and People datasets via the Socrata Open Data API, applies cleaning and aggregation, and trains a logistic regression model to compare the predictive weight of environmental conditions versus human factors. Produced as a final project for IS477 at the University of Illinois Urbana-Champaign.",
